Revision history for DBD-ClickhouseNG

0.52.01 2026-11-26
       - CI/CD

0.52   2026-11-26
       - No code changes, only updates to the CI/CD.

0.51   2026-11-20
       - mTLS: DSN keys tls_cert_file, tls_key_file, tls_ca_file;
         sends X-ClickHouse-SSL-Certificate-Auth: on with a client certificate.
       - Tests: offline t/27-mtls.t; live, env-parameterized t/58-live-mtls.t
         (CHNG_TEST_MTLS_*, skipped when unset); t/57-live-tls.t endpoint now
         comes from CHNG_TEST_TLS_* instead of hard-coded hosts.
       - Internal restructuring: the driver is split into single-responsibility
         modules (dr, db, st, Catalog, Placeholders, Types, Error). No
         functional change.

0.50   2026-07-20
       - Catalog/introspection: table_info, column_info, type_info_all,
         primary_key_info.
       - Bounded-batch streaming fetch for large result sets
         (fetch_batch_rows).
       - TLS/SSL support, including an opt-in insecure mode (tls_insecure).
       - get_info, data_sources, ParamArrays, ChopBlanks.
       - CPAN packaging cleanup: LICENSE file (Artistic 1.0 / GPL v3+),
         MANIFEST brought back in sync with the shipped test suite.

0.001  2026-07-19
       - Initial implementation per DESIGN.md.
